OL,4,BThe tightest survival scrap for years? 
OL,5,BWhy it's not too early to worry        
OL,6,GDespite being only 10 games into the   
OL,7,Gseason, sitting in the relegation zone 
OL,8,Geven at this early stage is more       
OL,9,Gworrying than you might think.         
OL,11,FBut with how tight the Premier League  
OL,12,Ftable is, this could also be one of    
OL,13,Fthe fiercest relegation battles we     
OL,14,Fhave seen in a long time.              
OL,16,FTwo of the current bottom three,       
OL,17,FCrystal Palace and Manchester United,  
OL,18,Fwill resume their campaigns at the     
OL,19,Fweekend with new managers after        
OL,20,Fappointing Thomas Frank and Mauricio   
OL,21,FPochettino respectively.               
